            <title>[LU-19485] Add deprecation warning to LNet code for ip2nets/routes</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19485</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;If LNet sees that ip2nets/routes parameters are supplied, log a deprecation warning upon module initialization.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Update the module parameter description in LNet to note their deprecation&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Wrap relevant code in a version macro so that it will disable itself for Lustre 2.18&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
